      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "5.2 功能逻辑"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "52-功能逻辑"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "start": null,
        "spread": false,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "不完整的非 MySQL 列血缘分析导致正常查询执行前失败（保留 SQL 行为分析、权限校验和安全规则检查）"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "初始化升级阶段加载安全规则插件时全局服务未注册导致初始化失败"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "并发结果脱敏时原子类型缓存可能抛出 ConcurrentModificationException"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "表结构强制刷新仍读取旧缓存、全局查询安全规则未生效、安全规则手动修改参数不生效、规则详情布局错位、环境备注无法清空、Doris 物化视图无法展开"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "5.3 交互与数据"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "53-交互与数据"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "start": null,
        "spread": false,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "SQL 审计时间筛选、时区转换、总数分页、自定义列渲染、空用户名写入失败"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "工单重复提交、执行状态不自动刷新、恢复的 SQL 页签无法输入"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "大 SQL 工单详情未继续分段加载、追加内容后阅读位置跳动"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "数据源删除确认信息不直观"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "数据源保存后临时上传的证书附件未清理"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
